    "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid to complete each level by activating and then stepping onto every goal cell. A goal is only completed when the carried piece\u2019s shape, color, and rotation exactly match that goal cell\u2019s required attributes; completing all goals advances to the next level, and completing all levels wins.",
    "mechanics_understanding": "Each turn you choose a movement action (north/south/east/west). Walls can block movement, causing you to stay in place while still spending stamina. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape modifiers cycle the piece\u2019s shape, color modifiers cycle its color, and rotation modifiers rotate it 90\u00b0 clockwise. When the piece\u2019s attributes match a goal\u2019s requirements, that goal becomes activated; you must then move onto the goal cell to complete it. Stamina decreases with actions, and running out of stamina costs a life; losing all lives ends the game."
